sequenceDiagram
    participant SPA_Browser
    participant Server

    SPA_Browser->>Server: GET /spa
    Server-->>SPA_Browser: HTML shell

    SPA_Browser->>Server: GET /main.css
    Server-->>SPA_Browser: CSS content

    SPA_Browser->>Server: GET /spa.js
    Server-->>SPA_Browser: JavaScript SPA logic

    Note right of SPA_Browser: JavaScript runs and handles frontend behavior

    SPA_Browser->>Server: GET /data.json
    Server-->>SPA_Browser: Notes in JSON format

    Note right of SPA_Browser: Notes rendered without full page reload
